# Deployed on macOS only (see .chezmoiignore); Windows 1Password takes over
# the native OpenSSH agent pipe, so no config is needed there.
#
# Deliberately minimal. On some machines a management policy prepends its own
# directives to the top of this file, and ssh takes the first value it sees for
# an option, so anything written here can be silently outranked -- and chezmoi
# would end up contesting a file another process also writes. Per-repo key
# selection and any algorithm options live in core.sshCommand instead; see
# .config/git/identity-{open,work}.
Host *
    IdentityAgent "~/Library/Group Containers/2BUA8C4S2C.com.1password/t/agent.sock"
